{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 三期生 山口県出身🐡 21歳の\n谷口愛季(たにぐちあいり)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー 5 ーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobWZ1qlq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobe16wRO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 5th ANNIVERSARY LIVE\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう1ヶ月も経ってしまったそうです、、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ余韻に浸ってたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobh3b1KO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ステージに立つ度に\n自分が目指した アイドル という職業は\nなんて素敵なんだって思わされます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーの笑顔を見るだけで、\n自分まで幸せな気持ちになれます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何度も笑っている姿を見ているはずなのに、\n心の底からぶわーーって幸せな気持ちが湧き上がってくるの凄くないですか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイドルってすごいですね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も、もっともっと自分の目指した\nアイドルというものを突き詰めていきたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobMXNaT9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobypgWuP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob4eEb3w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob7IUinj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobBiabrf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob0i35Qm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「内側見た時どうするー？目合わす？しーの方見る？\n目合わせたら笑っちゃいそう」\nとか言ってたのに多分一番に泣いてた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobUnBnU2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "I will be披露させていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "冒頭のダンストラック、ソファで登場している時\n緊張なのか、わくわくからなのか分かりませんが、心臓が震えました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "忘れられないです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時だけは、\n私がこの会場の景色を独り占めしてるんだ！と\n嬉しくなりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏の近道 もメンバー全員で披露することができて、とっても嬉しかったです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩や後輩がラスサビを踊っているのが\nかわいくてかわいくてしょうがなかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type"